{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"pass\": true,\n  \"problems\": [],\n  \"unexplained\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-B5\",\n      \"why\": \"缺前提\",\n      \"note\": \"现有H1、H2确立的是这份牵挂的重要性、无法重新握住它的难过，以及越来越清楚的靠近愿望，并没有确立“不甘心就这样消亡”的负隅顽抗动因。若要把这种动因写成确定的心理因果，需要前段另有铺垫。不过，将它作为另一种可能的心理动因独立保留是合理的，并非借口；听感本身也没有充分理由被判为存疑。尤其不能用M22的持续用力来替代对这种抗拒意志的解释。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"reason\": \"第1至第6条均与候选原话一致，历史依赖有已解释过的前段听感作为依据，且各条分别解释了现在能够站住、承认在乎带来的欢喜、依靠自我控制、逐渐费力、再次聚力时的动摇以及末尾的疲倦，没有明显添加外部事件或多余的心理步骤。S02-B5没有被解释为确定事实，但其独立保留符合它作为另一种心理动因的定位；本段最重要的听感已有合理解释，因此合格。\"\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0811d112-8ba1-4a38-a27c-a340be51174f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T033900339245Z", "elapsed_seconds": 268.109, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T03:43:28.470956+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8c50aa27b047f223f8ac4a6a536e34415de94f8ec546f6efc82300539d1a6a20", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed